This work (the entire project — code in hooks/, voice/, .claude/, setup
scripts, and documentation, as well as any bundled model files) is licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0).

Why the whole project uses this license (not just the bundled model):
the Korean TTS model this project bundles (vits-mimic3-ko_KO-kss_low, based
on the KSS dataset) is itself licensed CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0. Its ShareAlike (SA)
clause requires any distribution that includes it to carry the same license.
Rather than splitting "permissive code + restricted model," this project
unifies under CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0 for the whole repository, matching the
decision recorded in docs/decisions.md (2026-09-25: "이 프로젝트를 완전
비상업... 조건 하에 사용 확정").

